## 2. Full content diff (counts matching does NOT prove files identical)

    diff -rq --exclude=target --exclude=out \
      "$H/reference/rust/gen" "$F/reference/rust/gen"

    diff -rq --exclude=target --exclude=out \
      "$H/reference/rust-f32/gen" "$F/reference/rust-f32/gen"

Nothing was piped into a command whose exit status was measured; `diff`
exit 0 = identical, 1 = differences.

## 3. Exhaustive symbol / signature scope

    grep -oP '^\s*(pub\s+)?(async\s+)?fn\s+[A-Za-z0-9_]+\s*\([^)]*\)(\s*->\s*[^{]+)?' "$f" \
      | sed -E 's/^\s+//; s/\s+/ /g; s/\s*$//'

An earlier name-only pass (`fn\s+[A-Za-z0-9_]+`) cannot see a changed
signature; only the signature pass does.

